    \u0111i\u1EC7n c\xF3 th\u1EC3 ng\u1EAFt g\xE2y k\u1EB9t v\xE0 ng\u1EA1t kh\xF3i.
    H\xE3y d\xF9ng thang b\u1ED9!"
